  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community-led Solution for Inclusive Socio-Economic Resilience towards Sustainable Peace in Conflict-Affected Areas in Ethiopia (Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced Social integration of local communities through a community-based operational system, strengthened conflict management capacity and establishment of a support system for conflict victims, increased agricultural productivity and strengthened food security through agricultural activities, improved employment opportunities for vulnerable groups through business capacity building</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced gender-sensitive social integration and peace-building between displaced persons and local communities within the community, improved capacity for managing conflict risks and responding to them within the community, and reduced vulnerability to climate change, strengthened economic self-reliance of displaced persons and enhanced economic resilience of local communities-&#xbd84;&#xc7c1;&#xd53c;&#xd574;&#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xb0b4; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xacf5;&#xb3d9;&#xccb4;&#xc758; &#xc7a0;&#xc7ac;&#xc801; &#xac08;&#xb4f1; &#xc6d0;&#xc778;&#xc744; &#xd30c;&#xc545;&#xd558;&#xace0; &#xd574;&#xacb0;&#xd558;&#xba70;, &#xc704;&#xd5d8;&#xad00;&#xb9ac;(&#xb300;&#xbe44;/&#xb300;&#xc751;/&#xc608;&#xce21;) &#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c;&#xc744; &#xccb4;&#xacc4;&#xc801;&#xc73c;&#xb85c; &#xc6b4;&#xc601;&#xd560; &#xc218; &#xc788;&#xb294; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;
-&#xc601;&#xb18d; &#xbc0f; &#xb18d;&#xc678;&#xc18c;&#xb4dd;&#xd65c;&#xb3d9;&#xc758; &#xd655;&#xb300; &#xbc0f; &#xc2dc;&#xc7a5;&#xb7;&#xae08;&#xc735; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xac1c;&#xc120;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd574; &#xbd84;&#xc7c1;&#xd53c;&#xd574;&#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xb0b4; &#xcde8;&#xc57d; &#xacc4;&#xce35;&#xc758; &#xacbd;&#xc81c;&#xd68c;&#xbcf5;&#xd0c4;&#xb825;&#xc131; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
